# NVIDIA free-tier API key for Phase 7 LLM translation.
# Dev: the Vite proxy (vite.config.ts) injects the Authorization header.
# Prod: the Vercel function api/nvidia/v1/chat/completions.ts does the same —
# set NVIDIA_API_KEY in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Either way the key is NEVER shipped to the browser.
# (Old name VITE_NVIDIA_API_KEY still works locally.)
#
# Get a key: https://build.nvidia.com (free tier, ~1000 requests/day)
NVIDIA_API_KEY=
